  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#Debug The Route Planner\r\n\r\n1. Run the app to display the initial route.\r\n2. Click **Add New Stop** and **Remove Last Stop** to modify the route.\r\n3. **Observe** which button actions cause the route data to become **inconsistent** (desynchronized) in the displayed cards.\r\n4. Use the debugging checklist to find and fix the problems.\r\n\r\n::: details [<i class=\"fa fa-clipboard\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Debugging Checklist**]\r\n   - What you expected to happen.  \r\n   - What actually happened.  \r\n   - Which part of the code you suspect might be causing the problem (no need to fix yet).\r\n:::\r\n&nbsp\r\n5. You may ask **AI** to explain why a bug is happening, then compare its explanation to your own and decide which fix is clearest and safest.\r\n6. In `reflection.md` file, compare your human hypothesis with the AI's suggestion:\r\n    - \"My guess was ___. AI suggested ___. The correct fix was ___.\"\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
